1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:03,553
You already speak some Arabic, every time you speak English.

2
00:00:03,553 --> 00:00:04,499
Here is the proof.

3
00:00:05,700 --> 00:00:07,442
Algebra comes from al jabr.

4
00:00:07,442 --> 00:00:08,991
Sugar comes from sukkar.

5
00:00:08,991 --> 00:00:10,733
And cotton comes from qutn.

6
00:00:11,933 --> 00:00:13,388
Coffee comes from qahwa.

7
00:00:13,388 --> 00:00:14,358
Sofa from suffa.

8
00:00:14,358 --> 00:00:15,874
And alcohol from al kuhl.

9
00:00:15,874 --> 00:00:17,633
Which one surprised you most?

